# Version 0.4.2 - 2026-05-06
- [fix][patch] Build fix for boost version 1.89.

# Version 0.4.1 - 2025-02-28
- [fix][patch] Explicitly include boost::weak_ptr.

# Version 0.4.0 - 2021-09-14
- [major][remove] Removed optional ROS/log4cxx support.

# Version 0.3.3 - 2021-06-29
- [minor][fix] Added dependency on Boost.

# Version 0.3.2 - 2021-03-08
- [minor][fix] Removed duplicate source file.

# Version 0.3.1 - 2020-11-10
- [minor][fix] Prevent output buffering from delaying log messages when stderr is redirected.

# Version 0.3.0 - 2020-11-02
- [minor][add] Systemd logging mode.

# Version 0.2.0 - 2020-05-29
- [major][change] Make ROS integration with log4cxx optional.
- [minor][change] Link with --as-needed.

# Version 0.1.3 - 2020-02-24
- [minor][add] Add environment flags for disabling syslog and console outputs (`DR_LOG_USE_SYSLOG` and `DR_LOG_USE_CONSOLE`).
